msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for your help. This is my first time\r\n"
"here in Kamurocho, so I have no idea where everything is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"I'm lucky you were there to show me where to go. You know,\r\n"
"I don't think I ever got your name..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you, Kiryu-san. I'm Tomoko. I go to college not\r\n"
"too far from Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "A college girl, huh? Good for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "What sort of work do you do, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "I run an orphanage in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"Whoa, an orphanage? That's so sweet! So you get to hang out with the kids "
"all day, keep them company?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"That's not really how it works. They need a parent to take care of them, "
"whether it's helping with schoolwork or making them dinner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "Oh, I see. Sorry, I'm not very smart..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"It's all right. Not many people know what kind of work goes into running an "
"orphanage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid ""
"Still, that's incredible, Kiryu-san! I have so much respect\r\n"
"for people who devote themselves to volunteering."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"You know, you might look scary, Kiryu-san, but you're a real\r\n"
"sweetheart deep down. I'm pretty into guys like that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid ""
"...So, where's this guy you're waiting for? Is he still\r\n"
"not here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid ""
"I guess not... But I'm having a good time talking with\r\n"
"you, Kiryu-san. I'll be okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Right..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Tomoko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "Oh, Fumiyoshi-kun! There you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"What the hell are you doing here in Kamurocho!? I told you\r\n"
"not to come here! How dumb are you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"What? But, but Fumiyoshi-kun... You never came home, so\r\n"
"I thought..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Like that's any of your business, you stupid bitch!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid "Why are you always so mean to me!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"Didn't you read my text!? I told you I didn't want to\r\n"
"see you right now!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid ""
"You never replied, so I had to come all the way out here\r\n"
"to find your dumb ass. Do you ever look at your phone,\r\n"
"or are you too stupid to use it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Huh? Wait, what text?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"Oh... I think I forgot my cell phone in my hotel room...\r\n"
"I'm sorry, I totally didn't notice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"Wow, what a surprise! You fucking moron! Now you've\r\n"
"wasted my time, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Is that any way to speak to her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell're you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I got lost on the way here, but he stopped to help and\r\n"
"walked me here himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"Then you got all friendly and started drinking together?\r\n"
"I see what's goin' on here. Why don't you hook up with this\r\n"
"old fart, then!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "That's not what I meant... Wait, Fumiyoshi-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "I'm out. I don't wanna see your face around here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Why don't you consider how she feels about this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Huh? What do you care about it, huh? And who the hell are\r\n"
"you, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"I got lost on the way here, but he stopped to help and\r\n"
"walked me here himself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid ""
"Uh-huh. Looks like he's takin' pretty good care of you, too.\r\n"
"Why don't you just hook up with this old fart, then!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "What!? Wait, Fumiyoshi-kun!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "I'm out. I don't wanna see your face around here again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Fumiyoshi-kun..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "That the guy you were waiting for?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid ""
"Yeah... He's my boyfriend. A year ago, he left our\r\n"
"countryside town for Kamurocho, but never came back..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"When I texted him, \"Can I come see you?\" he would always say\r\n"
"\"Hell no.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"Finally, I decided to follow him out here and try to meet\r\n"
"up with him, but it looks like he's really upset that I\r\n"
"did... I don't know what to do..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "If you need my help, I'll do what I can."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Really...? Oh, but I need to go get my cell phone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"I ran away from home, so I'm staying at a hotel for the\r\n"
"moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "You sure you won't get lost on the way to your hotel?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Hehe... Still worried about me, huh? Would you mind\r\n"
"walking me back to my hotel, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "Sure, no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "Thank you so much! Let's talk more about this at the hotel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid "I don't have time, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid ""
"But... what if I get lost again? Please, just one last time,\r\n"
"will you show me how to get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Is that any way to speak to her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Why don't you consider how she's feeling?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Sure, no problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid "I don't have time, sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
